            <ArticleTitle>New insights into ischemic heart disease in women.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>585-94</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Coronary artery disease is different in women than in men in its pathogenesis, symptoms, and prognosis. Needed is a strategy for detecting and assessing coronary disease specifically in women. This review highlights recent evidence on sex differences in coronary artery disease.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
